OL,3,AMission blasts off for Mars to grab a
OL,4,Apiece of its moon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spacecraft has launched from Japan
OL,7,Fheaded for Mars' moon Phobos, where it
OL,8,Fwill attempt to grab some moondust and
OL,9,Fbring it back to Earth.
OL,11,FIf it is successful, this will become
OL,12,Fthe first time a sample has been
OL,13,Freturned from Mars or its moons to be
OL,14,Fanalysed in laboratories here on Earth.
OL,16,FThe spacecraft is scheduled to arrive
OL,17,Fat Phobos in August 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
